This software downloads and runs the speech recognition model
"Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3" by NVIDIA, licensed under CC BY 4.0:
  Model:   https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3
  Licence: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
It is used as converted to ONNX and quantised to int8 by the sherpa-onnx
project (https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx), release asset
sherpa-onnx-nemo-parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3-int8. The model itself is not modified
further by Heyra.
